{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52283","headline":"诗（幷序） 四十四 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 四十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地下须夫急，逢头取次捉。\n一家抽一个，勘数申（项校作「由」，通「犹」）未足。\n科出排门夫，不许私遮却（戴谓此字衍）曲。\n合去取正身，名字付司录。\n棒驱火急走，向前任缚束。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}